{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Maak een bewerkbaar fotoreviewcarrousel-blok voor Susan’s Aspen Boutique.
    
    EDITOR
    Maak 8 reviewplekken rechtstreeks in de blokinstellingen, zonder geneste blokken. Per review:
    - Aan/uit.
    - Afbeeldingkiezer.
    - Fotopositie: Boven, Midden of Onder.
    - Reviewtekst.
    - Sterrenscore.
    
    Fotopositie stuurt object-position: center top, center center of center bottom. Standaard Midden. Bewaar alle ingevoerde inhoud bij wijzigingen.
    
    Algemene instellingen: titel, beoordelingslabel, gemiddelde score, reviewaantaltekst, kleuren, lettergroottes mobiel/desktop, boven-/onderruimte en kaartbreedte mobiel/desktop.
    
    OPBOUW EN STIJL
    Achtergrond #F2F2F2, tekst #111, themalettertype, normaal lettergewicht. Volgorde:
    1. Gecentreerde titel: HERE’S WHAT OUR CUSTOMERS SAY.
    2. Eén gecentreerde regel: Excellent 4.7/5 met vijf goudgele sterren ernaast.
    3. Vrij invulbare reviewaantaltekst; verbergen indien leeg.
    4. Fotoreviewkaarten.
    5. Pijlen en stippen.
    
    Titel desktop 30 px. Mobiel 16 px op één regel waar dit past; anders twee evenwichtige regels, nooit SAY alleen. Geef de kop 12 px zijruimte.
    Beoordeling mobiel 16 px, desktop 22 px; sterren 23/30 px. Tekst en sterren naast elkaar met 8 px tussenruimte. Excellent 4.7/5 niet afbreken. Score instelbaar, /5 altijd zichtbaar.
    Sterren #FFD21C. Bij 4.7 vier volle sterren en één 70% gevuld. Gebruik SVG met overlappende vulling, geen dubbele sterrenrij.
    Reviewaantal 15/19 px. Kopregels 12 px uit elkaar; 20 px tot kaarten. Sectiepadding 28 px boven/onder.
    
    KAARTBREEDTE
    Voeg schuifregelaars toe:
    - Mobiel: 75–94% van het zichtbare carrouselvenster, standaard 88%.
    - Desktop vanaf 990 px: 280–440 px, standaard 360 px.
    
    Meet W via clientWidth van het zichtbare venster, NOOIT scrollWidth van de kaartenrij. Bereken mobiele kaartbreedte als W maal het ingestelde percentage. Desktop gebruikt de ingestelde pixelbreedte. Begrens kaarten tot W minus 24 px.
    
    Sla de uitkomst op als CSS-variabele in pixels. Kaart: width en flex-basis gelijk aan deze variabele; flex-grow:0; flex-shrink:0; min-width:0; box-sizing:border-box.
    Venster: width:100%; max-width:1240px; margin:auto. Alle tussenliggende flex/grid-wrappers: min-width:0; max-width:100%. Geen width:max-content op de buitenste container.
    
    KAART EN FOTO
    Witte kaart, rand 1 px #DEDEDE, hoekradius 12 px, padding 12 px. Kaartafstand mobiel 12 px, desktop 20 px.
    Fotocontainer: width:100%; aspect-ratio:1/1; position:relative; overflow:hidden; padding:0; min-height:0; flex:none; border-radius:9px.
    Foto: position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover. Gebruik de gekozen fotopositie.
    Geen vaste fotohoogte, viewporthoogte, padding-bottom-truc of flex-grow.
    Placeholder: hetzelfde vierkante vlak, grijze achtergrond en gecentreerd icoon van 40 × 40 px; nooit een SVG die de kaart oprekt.
    Controle: bij W=375 px en kaartbreedte 88% is de kaart 330 px en de foto 304 × 304 px.
    
    Onder foto: 12 px ruimte, gecentreerde reviewsterren van 20 px, 12 px ruimte en volledige reviewtekst. Tekst mobiel 16 px, desktop 17 px, regelhoogte 1.45. Lege tekst verbergen. Kaarten bovenaan uitlijnen; hoogte volgt inhoud. Geen vaste hoogte of lege opvulling onder korte reviews.
    
    CARROUSEL
    Horizontale scrollcontainer met scroll-snap-type:x mandatory; kaarten scroll-snap-align:center. Begin-/eindruimte ieder (W - kaartbreedte)/2, zonder extra gap bij deze ruimte.
    Centreer iedere gekozen kaart vanuit het werkelijke kaartmidden minus de halve vensterbreedte. Geen opgetelde procentuele verschuivingen. Ook eerste en laatste kaart exact centreren.
    Herbereken bij resize, gewijzigde kaartbreedte en editorupdates. Behoud de actieve review. Verticaal scrollen verandert de horizontale positie niet. Geen horizontale pagina-overflow.
    
    NAVIGATIE
    22 px onder de kaarten: dunne zwarte linkerpijl, stippen, rechterpijl. Geen achtergrond achter pijlen. Actieve stip gevuld, overige omlijnd. Eén kaart per klik, mobiel swipen, toetsenbordbediening. Stippen volgen actieve kaart; verbergen bij één review. Autoplay uit.
    
    Beperk CSS/JavaScript tot dit blok. Controleer op 320, 375 en 430 px: vierkante foto’s/placeholders, werkende fotopositie en breedteregelaars, volledige tekst en centrering van iedere slide.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display:block; width:100%; max-width:100%; box-sizing:border-box; padding:28px 0; background:#F2F2F2; color:#111111; font-family:{{ settings.type_base_font_family.family }}, sans-serif; font-weight:400; }
  .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }} * { box-sizing:border-box; }
  .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%; max-width:100%; margin:0 auto; min-width:0; }
  .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading { margin:0 12px 12px; text-align:center; font-family:{{ settings.type_header_font_family.family }}, sans-serif; font-weight:400; font-size:30px; line-height:1.15; }
  .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__summary { display:flex; justify-content:center; align-items:center; gap:8px; margin:0 12px 12px; white-space:nowrap; font-size:22px; line-height:1.2; }
  .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__summary-score { white-space:nowrap; }
  .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__stars { display:inline-flex; gap:2px; color:#FFD21C; vertical-align:middle; }
  .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__star { display:block; width:var(--star-size); height:var(--star-size); }
  .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__count { margin:0 12px 20px; text-align:center; font-size:19px; line-height:1.3; }
  .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__count:empty { display:none; }
  .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__viewport { width:100%; max-width:1240px; margin:0 auto; overflow-x:auto; overflow-y:hidden; scroll-snap-type:x mandatory; scrollbar-width:none; min-width:0; }
  .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__viewport::-webkit-scrollbar { display:none; }
  .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track { display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:12px; width:100%; max-width:100%; min-width:0; }
  .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__spacer { flex:0 0 var(--edge-space,0px); width:var(--edge-space,0px); min-width:0; }
  .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card { width:var(--card-width,88%); flex:0 0 var(--card-width,88%); flex-grow:0; flex-shrink:0; min-width:0; box-sizing:border-box; align-self:flex-start; padding:12px; border:1px solid #DEDEDE; border-radius:12px; background:#fff; scroll-snap-align:center; }
  .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo { position:relative; width:100%; aspect-ratio:1/1; overflow:hidden; padding:0; min-height:0; flex:none; border-radius:9px; background:#e5e5e5; }
  .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo img { position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; }
  .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder { position:absolute; inset:0; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; background:#e5e5e5; }
  .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder svg { width:40px; height:40px; max-width:40px; max-height:40px; color:#666; }
  .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__review-stars { display:flex; justify-content:center; margin-top:12px; --star-size:20px; }
  .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__text { margin:12px 0 0; text-align:center; font-size:17px; line-height:1.45; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
  .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__text:empty { display:none; }
  .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__navigation { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:18px; margin:22px auto 0; min-width:0; }
  .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; width:32px; height:32px; padding:0; border:0; background:transparent; color:#111; cursor:pointer; }
  .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow:focus-visible,.ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dot:focus-visible { outline:2px solid #111; outline-offset:3px; }
  .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow svg { width:21px; height:21px; }
  .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dots { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:9px; }
  .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dot { width:10px; height:10px; padding:0; border:1px solid #111; border-radius:50%; background:transparent; cursor:pointer; }
  .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dot[aria-current="true"] { background:#111; }
  .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__navigation[data-single="true"] .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dots { display:none; }
  @media (max-width:749px) {
    .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading { font-size:16px; line-height:1.15; }
    .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__summary { font-size:16px; }
    .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__count { font-size:15px; }
    .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track { gap:12px; }
    .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__text { font-size:16px; }
    .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__summary .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__star { width:23px; height:23px; }
  }
  @media (min-width:750px) {
    .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track { gap:20px; }
    .ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card { width:var(--card-width,360px); flex-basis:var(--card-width,360px); }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<photo-review-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-mobile-percent="{{ block.settings.mobile_card_percent }}" data-desktop-width="{{ block.settings.desktop_card_width }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner">
    {% if block.settings.title != blank %}<h2 class="ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.title | escape }}</h2>{% endif %}
    <div class="ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__summary"><span class="ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__summary-score">{{ block.settings.rating_label | escape }} {{ block.settings.average_score | escape }}/5</span><span class="ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__stars" style="--star-size:{{ block.settings.summary_star_size }}px" aria-label="{{ block.settings.average_score | escape }} out of 5 stars">
      {% for i in (1..5) %}{% assign star_fraction = block.settings.average_score | times: 1.0 | minus: forloop.index0 %}{% if star_fraction > 1 %}{% assign star_fraction = 1 %}{% elsif star_fraction < 0 %}{% assign star_fraction = 0 %}{% endif %}<svg class="ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__star" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><defs><clipPath id="ai-star-{{ ai_gen_id }}-{{ forloop.index }}"><rect x="0" y="0" width="{{ star_fraction | times: 24 }}" height="24" /></clipPath></defs><path fill="#b8b8b8" d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87L18.18 21 12 17.77 5.82 21 7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01z"/><path clip-path="url(#ai-star-{{ ai_gen_id }}-{{ forloop.index }})" fill="#FFD21C" d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87L18.18 21 12 17.77 5.82 21 7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01z"/></svg>{% endfor %}
    </span></div>
    {% if block.settings.review_count_text != blank %}<p class="ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__count">{{ block.settings.review_count_text | escape }}</p>{% endif %}
    <div class="ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__viewport" tabindex="0" aria-label="Customer photo reviews"><div class="ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track"><div class="ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__spacer" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      {% assign enabled_count = 0 %}
      {% for i in (1..8) %}{% assign enabled_key = 'review_' | append: i | append: '_enabled' %}{% if block.settings[enabled_key] %}{% assign enabled_count = enabled_count | plus: 1 %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
      {% for i in (1..8) %}
        {% liquid
          assign enabled_key = 'review_' | append: i | append: '_enabled'
          assign image_key = 'review_' | append: i | append: '_image'
          assign position_key = 'review_' | append: i | append: '_position'
          assign text_key = 'review_' | append: i | append: '_text'
          assign rating_key = 'review_' | append: i | append: '_rating'
          assign enabled = block.settings[enabled_key]
          assign review_image = block.settings[image_key]
          assign review_position = block.settings[position_key]
          assign review_text = block.settings[text_key]
          assign review_rating = block.settings[rating_key]
          assign object_position = 'center center'
          if review_position == 'top'
            assign object_position = 'center top'
          elsif review_position == 'bottom'
            assign object_position = 'center bottom'
          endif
        %}
        {% if enabled %}<article class="ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card" data-review-index="{{ enabled_count | minus: enabled_count | plus: forloop.index0 }}">
          <div class="ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo">{% if review_image %}<img src="{{ review_image | image_url: width: 1000 }}" alt="{{ review_image.alt | default: 'Customer review photo' | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ review_image.width }}" height="{{ review_image.height }}" style="object-position:{{ object_position }}">{% else %}<div class="ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder">{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div>{% endif %}</div>
          <div class="ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__stars ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__review-stars" aria-label="{{ review_rating }} out of 5 stars">{% for star in (1..5) %}<svg class="ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__star" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="{% if star <= review_rating %}#FFD21C{% else %}#b8b8b8{% endif %}" d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87L18.18 21 12 17.77 5.82 21 7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01z"/></svg>{% endfor %}</div>
          {% if review_text != blank %}<p class="ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__text">{{ review_text | escape | newline_to_br }}</p>{% endif %}
        </article>{% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
      <div class="ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__spacer" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    </div></div>
    <div class="ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__navigation" data-single="false" aria-label="Review navigation"><button class="ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" type="button" data-direction="-1" aria-label="Previous review"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"/></svg></button><div class="ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dots"></div><button class="ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" type="button" data-direction="1" aria-label="Next review"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"/></svg></button></div>
  </div>
</photo-review-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
(function(){
  const tag='photo-review-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}';
  if(customElements.get(tag)) return;
  class PhotoReviewCarousel extends HTMLElement {
    connectedCallback(){
      this.viewport=this.querySelector('.ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__viewport');
      this.track=this.querySelector('.ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track');
      this.cards=Array.from(this.querySelectorAll('.ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card'));
      this.spacers=this.querySelectorAll('.ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__spacer');
      this.navigation=this.querySelector('.ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__navigation');
      this.dots=this.querySelector('.ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dots');
      if(!this.viewport||!this.track) return;
      this.active=0;
      this.dots.innerHTML='';
      this.cards.forEach((card,index)=>{const dot=document.createElement('button');dot.type='button';dot.className='ai-photo-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dot';dot.setAttribute('aria-label','Go to review '+(index+1));dot.addEventListener('click',()=>this.goTo(index));this.dots.appendChild(dot);});
      this.navigation.dataset.single=this.cards.length<=1?'true':'false';
      this.querySelectorAll('[data-direction]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>this.goTo(this.active+Number(button.dataset.direction))));
      this.viewport.addEventListener('keydown',event=>{if(event.key==='ArrowRight'){event.preventDefault();this.goTo(this.active+1);}if(event.key==='ArrowLeft'){event.preventDefault();this.goTo(this.active-1);}});
      this.viewport.addEventListener('scroll',()=>this.updateActive(),{passive:true});
      this.resizeObserver=new ResizeObserver(()=>this.resize());this.resizeObserver.observe(this.viewport);
      this.mutationObserver=new MutationObserver(()=>this.resize());this.mutationObserver.observe(this,{attributes:true,childList:true,subtree:true});
      this.resize();
    }
    disconnectedCallback(){if(this.resizeObserver)this.resizeObserver.disconnect();if(this.mutationObserver)this.mutationObserver.disconnect();}
    resize(){
      if(!this.viewport||!this.cards.length)return;
      const w=this.viewport.clientWidth;if(!w)return;
      const mobile=window.matchMedia('(max-width: 749px)').matches;
      const requested=mobile?w*Number(this.dataset.mobilePercent)/100:Number(this.dataset.desktopWidth);
      const width=Math.max(1,Math.min(requested,w-24));
      this.style.setProperty('--card-width',width+'px');
      const edge=Math.max(0,(w-width)/2);this.style.setProperty('--edge-space',edge+'px');
      this.cards.forEach(card=>{card.style.width='var(--card-width)';card.style.flexBasis='var(--card-width)';});
      const prior=Math.min(this.active,this.cards.length-1);requestAnimationFrame(()=>this.goTo(prior,false));
    }
    goTo(index,behavior=true){
      if(!this.cards.length)return;
      this.active=Math.max(0,Math.min(index,this.cards.length-1));
      const card=this.cards[this.active];const center=card.offsetLeft+card.offsetWidth/2;
      this.viewport.scrollTo({left:center-this.viewport.clientWidth/2,behavior:behavior?'smooth':'auto'});this.updateDots();
    }
    updateActive(){
      if(!this.cards.length)return;
      const center=this.viewport.scrollLeft+this.viewport.clientWidth/2;let nearest=0;let distance=Infinity;
      this.cards.forEach((card,index)=>{const d=Math.abs(card.offsetLeft+card.offsetWidth/2-center);if(d<distance){distance=d;nearest=index;}});
      this.active=nearest;this.updateDots();
    }
    updateDots(){this.dots.querySelectorAll('button').forEach((dot,index)=>dot.setAttribute('aria-current',index===this.active?'true':'false'));}
  }
  customElements.define(tag,PhotoReviewCarousel);
})();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Photo review carousel",
  "settings": [
    {"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop block width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},
    {"type":"header","content":"General"},
    {"type":"text","id":"title","label":"Title","default":"HERE’S WHAT OUR CUSTOMERS SAY"},
    {"type":"text","id":"rating_label","label":"Rating label","default":"Excellent"},
    {"type":"text","id":"average_score","label":"Average score","default":"4.7"},
    {"type":"text","id":"review_count_text","label":"Review count text","default":"Based on customer reviews"},
    {"type":"range","id":"summary_star_size","label":"Desktop summary star size","min":20,"max":40,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":30},
    {"type":"range","id":"mobile_card_percent","label":"Mobile card width","min":75,"max":94,"step":1,"unit":"%","default":88},
    {"type":"range","id":"desktop_card_width","label":"Desktop card width","min":280,"max":440,"step":10,"unit":"px","default":360},
    {"type":"header","content":"Reviews"},
    {"type":"checkbox","id":"review_1_enabled","label":"Review 1 enabled","default":true},
    {"type":"image_picker","id":"review_1_image","label":"Review 1 image"},
    {"type":"select","id":"review_1_position","label":"Review 1 photo position","options":[{"value":"top","label":"Top"},{"value":"center","label":"Center"},{"value":"bottom","label":"Bottom"}],"default":"center"},
    {"type":"textarea","id":"review_1_text","label":"Review 1 text","default":"A beautiful piece and wonderful quality."},
    {"type":"range","id":"review_1_rating","label":"Review 1 stars","min":1,"max":5,"step":1,"default":5},
    {"type":"checkbox","id":"review_2_enabled","label":"Review 2 enabled","default":true},
    {"type":"image_picker","id":"review_2_image","label":"Review 2 image"},
    {"type":"select","id":"review_2_position","label":"Review 2 photo position","options":[{"value":"top","label":"Top"},{"value":"center","label":"Center"},{"value":"bottom","label":"Bottom"}],"default":"center"},
    {"type":"textarea","id":"review_2_text","label":"Review 2 text","default":"Lovely fit, soft fabric, and fast delivery."},
    {"type":"range","id":"review_2_rating","label":"Review 2 stars","min":1,"max":5,"step":1,"default":5},
    {"type":"checkbox","id":"review_3_enabled","label":"Review 3 enabled","default":true},
    {"type":"image_picker","id":"review_3_image","label":"Review 3 image"},
    {"type":"select","id":"review_3_position","label":"Review 3 photo position","options":[{"value":"top","label":"Top"},{"value":"center","label":"Center"},{"value":"bottom","label":"Bottom"}],"default":"center"},
    {"type":"textarea","id":"review_3_text","label":"Review 3 text","default":"Exactly as pictured. I will shop here again."},
    {"type":"range","id":"review_3_rating","label":"Review 3 stars","min":1,"max":5,"step":1,"default":5},
    {"type":"checkbox","id":"review_4_enabled","label":"Review 4 enabled","default":true},
    {"type":"image_picker","id":"review_4_image","label":"Review 4 image"},
    {"type":"select","id":"review_4_position","label":"Review 4 photo position","options":[{"value":"top","label":"Top"},{"value":"center","label":"Center"},{"value":"bottom","label":"Bottom"}],"default":"center"},
    {"type":"textarea","id":"review_4_text","label":"Review 4 text","default":"Great service and a gorgeous blouse."},
    {"type":"range","id":"review_4_rating","label":"Review 4 stars","min":1,"max":5,"step":1,"default":5},
    {"type":"checkbox","id":"review_5_enabled","label":"Review 5 enabled","default":true},
    {"type":"image_picker","id":"review_5_image","label":"Review 5 image"},
    {"type":"select","id":"review_5_position","label":"Review 5 photo position","options":[{"value":"top","label":"Top"},{"value":"center","label":"Center"},{"value":"bottom","label":"Bottom"}],"default":"center"},
    {"type":"textarea","id":"review_5_text","label":"Review 5 text","default":"Comfortable, flattering, and easy to style."},
    {"type":"range","id":"review_5_rating","label":"Review 5 stars","min":1,"max":5,"step":1,"default":5},
    {"type":"checkbox","id":"review_6_enabled","label":"Review 6 enabled","default":true},
    {"type":"image_picker","id":"review_6_image","label":"Review 6 image"},
